### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### Get a contact by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6a03e6dbdc93a0b635d0fe4d

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "User",
    "email": "test@email.com",
    "favoriteColor": "blue",
    "birthday": "1990-01-01"
}

### Update a contact by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/6a03e6dbdc93a0b635d0fe4d
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "favoriteColor": "yellow"
}

### Delete a contact by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/6a0d3047c74b20bfab3c7629

